  "description": "Vali-Validation is a lightweight and extensible .NET validation library designed as an alternative to FluentValidation. It provides a fluent and expressive API to define validation rules for objects and properties in a clear and intuitive way. Supporting common validation scenarios like null checks, string patterns, date and numeric constraints, and collection rules, Vali-Validation is optimized for maintainability and scalability. It integrates seamlessly into .NET applications with support for dependency injection and is ideal for projects following clean or onion architecture.",
  "iconFile": "logo_vali_validation.png",
