  "published": "2025-04-16T22:27:30.897Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Vali-Validation v1.0.0 introduces a lightweight, expressive, and extensible validation framework for .NET developers:\n            - Fluent, chainable syntax for defining validation rules with clarity and precision.\n            - Built-in support for common scenarios: null checks, empty values, length restrictions, regular expressions, numeric comparisons, date validations, and collection rules.\n            - Designed to integrate seamlessly into projects using Onion or Clean Architecture, promoting separation of concerns through validator classes.\n            - Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0 and above, ensuring broad framework support.\n            - Ideal alternative to FluentValidation, with simpler customization and a focus on maintainability.\n\n            Vali-Validation empowers developers to write clean, testable, and reusable validation logic across applications.",
  "repository": "",
